    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0598" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg522"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17914</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Letcher to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-17T17:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 17, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>All troops apparently are being withdrawn from territory covered by American
                    soldiers and preparations are being made for these to go south, probably to
                    Parral.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
